# Local observability stack: generated Grafana admin password (never commit)
infra/observability/.local-secrets/

# Saved Terraform plans are APPLIABLE artifacts and can embed values: never commit them, whatever they are named.
# (An earlier `tfplan-final` and `terraform-plan-final-readable.txt` slipped through narrower patterns.)
tfplan*
*.tfplan*
terraform-plan*
*plan*.out
plan.out
*.tfplan.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Local scratch space for plan output (the safe place to write `terraform plan -out=...`)
/.tfplan-scratch/
